{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05155","headline":"奉和圣制同二相已下羣官乐游园宴 · 赵冬曦","name":"奉和圣制同二相已下羣官乐游园宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爽垲三秦地，芳华二月初。\n酺承奠璧罢，宴是合钱余。\n柳翠垂堪结，桃红卷欲舒。\n从容会鵷鹭，延曼戏龙鱼。\n喜气流云物，欢声浃里闾。\n圣恩将报厚，请述记言书。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵冬曦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05155.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05155","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}